OL,13,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,14,FShowers on Monday morning, becoming
OL,15,Fdry in the afternoon. Rain spreading
OL,16,Feast on Tuesday morning followed by
OL,17,Fshowers. Further rain spreading
OL,18,Fnortheast on Wednesday.
